# Cursor Procurement Rules

## Project Goal
Summarize vendor procurement risks and identify approval blockers.

## Working Constraints
- Do not approve purchases.
- Do not contact vendors.
- Do not infer legal approval.

## Allowed and Forbidden Operations
- Web access: forbidden
- Network access: forbidden
- Filesystem read: allowed
- Filesystem write: forbidden

## Human Confirmation Rules
- Any purchase or vendor commitment is requested -> ask_confirmation

## Output Expectations
- Format: markdown
- Language: en
- Section: Procurement Decision
- Section: Missing Inputs
- Section: Risk Notes
- Section: Manual Approval

